        "First, Single-Step Traversal: ArrowDown and ArrowUp move the active highlighted index by one step. If the list is closed, ArrowDown immediately expands the listbox and focuses the first item, while ArrowUp expands the listbox and focuses the last item. If the highlight is on the last item, ArrowDown cleanly wraps around to index zero (or stops at boundaries if wrapping is disabled by configuration).",
